<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41703" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhoetēus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥοιτειος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the promontory of
			Rhœteum</i>, <i>Rhœtean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">profundum,</span>”
				<i>the sea that washes it</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 197</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 30, 33, § 125</span></i>
			; and <i>subst.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhoeteum rapax,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					4, 279</span></i>
			.— Hence <b>poet.</b>, in gen., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Troy</i>,
				<i>Trojan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ductor,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Æneas</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 12, 456</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					6, 351</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fata,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					1, 115</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhoetē-ĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>Trojan</i>, and transf. for
				<i>Roman</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 431</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pubes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 9,
					621</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lancea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					17, 197</span></i>
			.</div>
